# The local modelling cache (data/local/) is COMMITTED, not ignored. It was
# expected to be hundreds of MB; zstd parquet makes the whole thing 5.2 MB, and
# at that size committing it is strictly better: every machine and every CI run
# gets the same offline dataset with no pull step and no credentials. It is
# regenerable at any time with scripts/pull_local_cache.py.
#
# Safe to commit because it holds no secrets — game stats and public odds — and
# because the cache is only read when a caller explicitly activates it, which
# only the backtest and trainer do. The live scorer and the daily pipeline never
# activate it, so a stale copy on the worker cannot reach live picks.
# ncaaf_live: big rebuild caches stay out; the four SERVING artifacts are
# committed so the Railway worker's checkout can run the gameday loop
# (the session-51 UFC lesson: registry without artifacts = silent no-op).
ncaaf_live/data/
!ncaaf_live/data/artifacts/
ncaaf_live/data/artifacts/*
!ncaaf_live/data/artifacts/remaining_home.txt
!ncaaf_live/data/artifacts/remaining_away.txt
!ncaaf_live/data/artifacts/remaining_meta.json
!ncaaf_live/data/artifacts/score_distribution.npz
!ncaaf_live/data/artifacts/score_distribution.meta.json

# Comparison-run artifacts (`python -m models.trainer --no-register`).
# Never real models: they exist to be measured against and thrown away.
models/saved/_baseline/
# analysis dumps, never committed (2026-09-11)
data/local/prop_dump/
data/local/*.csv
data/local/over_lean*.csv

# ── Repo diet (2026-09-14): inactive versioned model artifacts ───────────────
# Keep the LIVE scoring .pkl (model_registry.is_active = 1), not merely the
# newest filename per model_id. Older versioned pkls are gitignored AND
# `git rm --cached` so new clones stay thin; bytes remain in git history.
# Canonical keep-list: models/saved/MANIFEST.md. ACTIVE artifacts and
# models/saved/nfl_prop_params.json stay tracked. Cloud restore for a missing
# active file is model_artifacts via models.trainer._restore_artifact — but
# many live artifacts have NO blob, so git is still the worker's copy.
#
# Pattern: ignore all timestamped pkls, then un-ignore the keep set.
models/saved/*_????????_??????.pkl
